From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rezoss <rezoss79@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Use existing SA token before proactive refresh

When SmartSuggestions already has Samsung Account auth in memory, do not
force a proactive custom-card token refresh just because the 23 hour
refresh interval expired. This keeps the existing token usable for the
first request and still leaves the forced refresh path after a real
AUTH_SA_ERROR untouched.

---
 .../aiagent/data/source/CustomCardScsSuggestionClient.smali      | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/aiagent/data/source/CustomCardScsSuggestionClient.smali b/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/aiagent/data/source/CustomCardScsSuggestionClient.smali
--- a/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/aiagent/data/source/CustomCardScsSuggestionClient.smali
+++ b/smali_classes14/com/samsung/android/smartsuggestions/feature/aisuggestion/aiagent/data/source/CustomCardScsSuggestionClient.smali
@@ -700,7 +700,7 @@
 
     move-result p2
 
-    if-nez p2, :cond_3
+    if-nez p2, :goto_2
 
     sget-object p0, Ljava/lang/Boolean;->TRUE:Ljava/lang/Boolean;
 
